{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you love ramen? Do you want to make your own ramen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/1000048541.gif?t=1743044969\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will make your dream come true; you will be fascinated and immerse yourself in the world of ramen. From selecting ingredients to make the soup, the type of noodle, sauce, and aroma oil, to a variety of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a ramen universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/IceCream.gif?t=1743044969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Authentic or Unique?</strong> \u2013 Craft traditional ramen with classic ingredients or experiment with bold, creative flavors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd62 <strong>Endless Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose from a huge variety of broths, noodles, toppings, and seasonings to build your perfect bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Create Your Signature Menu</strong> \u2013 Design your own personalized ramen menu to show off your culinary style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Ramen Mt.Fuji Mode</strong> \u2013 Stack toppings as high as possible in this fun, chaotic challenge to create the tallest ramen tower ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Special Challenges &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Test your skills in themed events and unlock exclusive ingredients and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Become a Ramen Legend</strong> \u2013 Build your reputation, earn achievements, and become the ultimate ramen master!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574020?t=1743044969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574020?t=1743044969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/1127e7255fdcb301e9754429b70714fd5de21cde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743044969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/1127e7255fdcb301e9754429b70714fd5de21cde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743044969","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you love ramen? Do you want to make your own ramen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/1000048541.gif?t=1743044969\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will make your dream come true; you will be fascinated and immerse yourself in the world of ramen. From selecting ingredients to make the soup, the type of noodle, sauce, and aroma oil, to a variety of toppings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a ramen universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/extras/IceCream.gif?t=1743044969\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf5c <strong>Authentic or Unique?</strong> \u2013 Craft traditional ramen with classic ingredients or experiment with bold, creative flavors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd62 <strong>Endless Customization</strong> \u2013 Choose from a huge variety of broths, noodles, toppings, and seasonings to build your perfect bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Create Your Signature Menu</strong> \u2013 Design your own personalized ramen menu to show off your culinary style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Ramen Mt.Fuji Mode</strong> \u2013 Stack toppings as high as possible in this fun, chaotic challenge to create the tallest ramen tower ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Special Challenges &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Test your skills in themed events and unlock exclusive ingredients and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Become a Ramen Legend</strong> \u2013 Build your reputation, earn achievements, and become the ultimate ramen master!</p>","developers":["SECRET CHARACTER","HaconN"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574020/be030fe00846d8f0f6a9b4e189b81780233fd807/header.jpg?t=1743044969","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 SECRET CHARACTER \u00a9 Flyhigh Works","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114553,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114553/movie480.mp4?t=1743042628","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114553/movie_max.mp4?t=1743042628"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114553/c3e72f5e18cca09a9e3890fbfac2aedcce85f2da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743042628","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114553/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743042628","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571